WEBVTT

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:03.200
A field is not one uniform surface.

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:05.233
John Deere connects positioning,

00:00:05.233 --> 00:00:07.167
machine displays, and field data

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:09.300
to help farmers work more precisely.

00:00:09.433 --> 00:00:11.867
StarFire positioning helps align passes.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.767
JDLink sends equipment data

00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:15.300
to Operations Center,

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.333
where farmers can review performance

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:18.833
and plan the next job.

00:00:18.967 --> 00:00:21.033
The point is not just a smarter tractor.

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:22.800
It is a connected operation,

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.433
guided by better information.
